OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny showers
OL,6,Fwill die away through this evening.
OL,7,FThen the rest of the night will be
OL,8,Fmainly dry with clear periods. Chilly
OL,9,Fin some sheltered glens.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FStarting off dry with some
OL,12,Fsunshine. Cloudier in the afternoon
OL,13,Fwith a few passing showers.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,16,Fdry over the weekend with sunny
OL,17,Fspells. Rain likely to spread
OL,18,Fnortheast on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
